    description = "Every item and every creature in the game beside your inventory: how an item is made and what it is used in, what a creature drops, how it is tamed and where it lives.\n\nOpen your inventory, the crafting tab or a bench and a column shows at the right, with your favourites along the top. The game's own screens move over to make room for it. The column has two sides, Items and Bestiary.\n\n- Click an item for its recipes, what it is used in, the raw materials for any number of it, and its stats and description\n- Beside a bench the list can show only what that bench makes, with what you can make right now first. Click one to choose it there\n- The time every recipe takes and the XP it gives, for one craft and for a whole order\n- The Bestiary lists every creature: what it drops, how it is tamed, where it lives, and its health, damage, speeds and senses at the level you pick\n- A creature's page shows it in 3D: drag to turn it, scroll to zoom. A mount can wear its saddles\n- This map only: a switch that cuts the Bestiary down to the creatures of the map you are on. The list can also be put in order by a stat, such as fastest or most health\n- Search by name or pick a category on either side. Items are in the order they come in the game\n- Favourites: press A or the middle mouse button on any item or creature, and drag them into the order you want\n- Keep an order (an item and how many of it) and what it takes is one click away\n\nR shows how the item under the mouse is made and U what it is used in. F10 hides the panels, or shows them when no game screen is open. The key can be changed on the mod's card.\n\nThis mod was called Recipe Browser. Your favourites and settings stay.\n\nNeeds Wax 0.3.0 or newer.",
